<title>USA: U.S. weekly railcar loadings-wk ended Sept 21.</title>
<headline>U.S. weekly railcar loadings-wk ended Sept 21.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Association of American Railroads reported weekly railcar loadings as follows:</p>
<p>    -		Pct Change   Week Ending:	   Year-Ago</p>
<p>    -		   In Week---09/21/96  09/14/96     Week</p>
<p> Grain		     0.7	18,931    18,800    27,896</p>
<p> Grain Mill Products  -4.3	 8,866     9,267     9,483</p>
<p> Other Farm Products  22.8	 1,157	 942     1,210</p>
<p> Metallic Ores	   8.6	19,516    17,977    20,436</p>
